Subject: [PATCH 03/16] asan build fixes

Fixes for following components to check if DTHEROCK_SANITIZER=ASAN or
ASAN_HOST flag is set and then enabling asan specific build flags:
- aqlprofile
- roctracer
- miopen

CMake fixes to pass the THEROCK_SANITIZER flag for the aqlprofile,
roctracer and miopen component builds

