3) miopen
- pass -DTHEROCK_SANITIZER flag to MIOpen from therock build script
- if asan build is enabled, then use mcmodel=medium build flag to
  fix the linking error due to big library size on asan builds:

  relocation R_X86_64_PC32 out of range: -2294147428 is not in
  [-2147483648, 2147483647];)

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
